# pytest cache artifact: created by running the test suite, not authored
# content. Running `tox -e github`'s test step before the prettier step
# creates this directory, so without the ignore, prettier fails on a file
# no one wrote (same class of gate non-determinism as .superpowers/ below).
.pytest_cache/

# Agent plan workspace: ephemeral scratch (briefs, reports, review packages).
# Never committed, so its formatting is not the repo's concern — and letting it
# reach prettier makes the lint gate fail based on which scratch files happen
# to exist at the time.
.superpowers/
